{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53113","headline":"酬李端山中见期不至（题拟） · 张芬","name":"酬李端山中见期不至（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君家旧林壑，寄在乱峰西。\n近日春云满，相思路亦迷。\n闻钟投野寺，待月过前溪。\n怅望成幽梦，依依识故蹊。\n（见江标影宋书棚本《唐诗五十家小集·李端诗集》卷二）（按：《全唐诗》卷二八五收此诗於李端名下，题作《酬前大理寺评事张芬》。\n检影宋书棚本，此诗附於李端《山中期张芬不至》後，题作《酬前》，署「大理评事张芬」。\n此爲张芬诗附收於李集，作李诗误。\n另参本书卷十一苗发诗附考。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张芬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53113.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53113","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}